Package: ptmlink
Title: Query PTMlink, a Database of Glycosite-Phosphosite Co-Variation in Human Tumors
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Effram", "Wei", email = "ewei6@jh.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads the PTMlink release: pairs of an N-linked glycosylation site and a
    phosphorylation site ranked by cross-cohort co-variation over the release's CPTAC tumor
    cohorts (listed with their count by ptm_cohorts()), with a composition-adjusted correlation,
    stable site and pair identifiers and a per-cohort breakdown on every reported pair. The
    package reads the same per-gene data files the website reads, from a local copy or on
    demand from the website with checksum verification, and follows the website's default
    view (total evidence sorts; same-protein pairs hidden with their count; at least two
    cohorts; the adjusted, parent-protein and self-coupling annotations displayed and
    filterable, never sortable). Whole-database questions run over the released Parquet table
    through 'arrow'; the reading rules on any pair are returned as typed fields; every reported
    site is listed with its identifier, canonical position and AlphaFold position; a
    machine-readable reference describes every function, column and rule. Installs and checks
    without the release present.
